VERDICT     PASS -- every one of the 311 matvecs in the token reproduced ref/run9b's stream bit-exactly, in program order, on one open device, and the argmax over the card's OWN 248320 logits is token 2614 -- the same token ref/run9b picked
SCOPE       subsystem A only.  The 64 RMS norms and the final norm, the 64 residual adds,
            the 32 SwiGLUs and the whole Gated DeltaNet or attention block of every
            layer ran on the HOST.  B, C and D are not on this silicon, so this is the
            MATVEC SKELETON of a token, not a token the card computed by itself.
            ONE token, ONE position, ONE prompt.  Coverage of the input space is not
            coverage of the output space: this exercises one activation per job at the
            exponents this prompt happens to produce, and reaches no saturation corner
            and no row count other than the shapes the model has.
